BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heli Hartikainen: Interbody + Flux
DTSTART:20260901T160000Z
DTEND:20260901T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260909T123721Z
UID:6ss64dhi6cs66bb66csm2b9kcoojeb9ocpgjab9o75i3eohh74s6adplc4@google.com
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260806T023925Z
DESCRIPTION:Äänen Lumo\, Toinen kerros.\n\nPay what you can.\n\nTuesday 
 1.9.2026 at 19.00 at Toinen Kerros\, award-winning saxophonist\, composer 
 and sound artist Heli Hartikainen performs two works: Interbody (released 
 as an EP in April 2026)\, and a pre-premiere of Flux\, an upcoming commiss
 ion for Oulu2026. \n\nCal Cashin from Loud and Quiet Magazine wrote: “In
 terbody is a delight in exploratory noise making. Hartikainen’s sax is m
 eshed with the live electronics of an erratic sampler\, with their playing
  percussive and rolling to match the barrage of scattergun electronics\; a
  barbed and pointy exemplar of contemporary soundscape work.” \n\nFlux\,
  a work for tenor saxophone\, electromechanical solenoids\, sensor control
 led electronics and speakers\, is a commission for Oulu2026 European Capit
 al of Culture and will be performed at Oulu Cathedral on 18.9.2026.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260806T031458Z
LOCATION:Äänen Lumo ry\, Nokiantie 2-4\, 00510 Helsinki\, Suomi
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-JAZZFI-SOURCE:gcal
END:VEVENT
