SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260822T072255Z
DESCRIPTION:OAF 2026 international guest artist Susanne Brokesch (USA) wil
 l perform at the Pertin Valinta Stage on August 22\, 2026. The second arti
 st of the evening is guitarist Lauri Hyvärinen.\n\n18:00 doors\n18.30 Lau
 ri Hyvärinen\n19.30 Susanne Brokesch\n\nSusanne Brokesch is a New York-ba
 sed artist who has released music on legendary labels such as Cheap Record
 s\, Disko-B\, and Sähkö Recordings. In her first Finnish performance\, e
 lectronic experimentalism intertwines with melancholic folk and fractured 
 blues tones.\n\nLauri Hyvärinen is a sound artist and musician whose prim
 ary instrument and sound source is the guitar. In Hyvärinen’s performan
 ces\, free improvisation and minimalism are combined with precise composit
 ional thinking. Through these methods\, he explores the music for a strong
 \, shared experience of presence and space.\n\nTickets: 5 / 10 / 15 € (p
 ay what you can).
LAST-MODIFIED:20260822T072359Z
LOCATION:Pertin Valinta\, Hakaniemenkuja 2\, 00530 Helsinki\, Suomi
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-JAZZFI-SOURCE:gcal
END:VEVENT
