BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Something Else #17 - Castrillón & Smith
DTSTART:20260827T160000Z
DTEND:20260827T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260909T123721Z
UID:4mbph264rs9rib2p9qgbi7jk9h@google.com
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260807T172315Z
DESCRIPTION:Something Else #17 is coming up 27.8! First-time duo with cell
 ist / multi-instrumentalist <a href="https://www.facebook.com/daniel.arcil
 a.372019?__cft__[0]=AZb7cTfczQ3-0cHHkLT5rc2UxnFPlYKxKMNzZCdFs2M_otRsRy439L
 EKoRaqwGi4LAlJ0Jg2z-pMaYNh2k3rA9ccBjP-n0mKLvb_lwt1ob_AWgw-wzdjeWHopPWznbdw
 Bm3bBKUXBTjSFsSjPXIkjILNzB36HEms2wYFuLEJMKzpl4ijT_fqYew0BdZ8NWYuA58&__tn__
 =-]K-R">Daniel Sebastian Castrillon Arcila</a> is sure to satisfy your cel
 listic and spiritual needs this late-summer at <a href="https://www.instag
 ram.com/_u/musta_kissa_bar?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFQR05Val
 pSOVU2YTh5R081c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHvOrRbRFI8XC2XtIeTYt
 kBt8-30yT4FRneqiQ1yQzzdfiUyTDRDN_JwqvS2F_aem_ykM-U7dY-uzMgfsRAKAUHA">Musta
  Kissa</a> <br><br>2 sets<br>Suggested donation €10-25 (mobilepay or cas
 h)<br><br>SOMETHING ELSE vol. 17 | Castrillón/Smith<br><br>8 strings and 
 a handful of flutes mark a first-time duo between cellist/multi-instrument
 alists Sebastián Castrillón (CO) and Wilson Tanner Smith (US/FI)\, whose
  backgrounds in diverse genres and disciplines across the Americas and Eur
 ope come together at the 17th edition of Something Else at Musta Kissa!<br
 ><br>SOMETHING ELSE is a concert series for improvised music focused on ne
 w meetings of musicians from across Helsinki's free improv\, experimental\
 , jazz\, electronic\, and global music scenes\, held on the 4th Thursday o
 f each month at Kallio's Musta Kissa bar. New small-ensemble groupings--of
 ten first-time meetings--are highlighted each time\, with an emphasis on s
 urprise\, difference\, curiosity\, energy\, and connection.<br><br>SEBASTI
 ÁN CASTRILLÓN is a Colombian cellist\, bass player\, and composer. His i
 nterests as a musician and artist range across various modern sound expres
 sions\, including electroacoustic music\, rock\, jazz\, Latin American mus
 ic\, and free improvisation. He has worked in multidisciplinary settings w
 ith visual art\, dance\, and theatre. He is committed to reaching diverse 
 audiences and strives to create music and art that has a real social impac
 t on the world around us. <br><a href="https://instagram.com/sebastian_cas
 tree?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFQR05ValpSOVU2YTh5R081c3J0YwZh
 cHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHvnI8pQhx-qUrsPiWteiQVpMFJ5zQqAjfg9FOWimVz
 3TRQkgb4FPGMWLhsXB_aem_KK64NVyPcLfMc0lx_KoKIw">Instagram.com/sebastian_cas
 tree</a><br><br>WILSON TANNER SMITH is a cellist\, composer\, improviser\,
  and theatre artist currently based in Helsinki. His musical sensibility i
 s informed by free improvisation/free jazz\, ambient\, DIY and found sound
 s\, and by many cross-cultural/-genre collaborations in his former hometow
 n\, Chicago\, and more recently across northern/western Europe.<br><a href
 ="https://www.wilsontannersmith.com/?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlk
 ETFQR05ValpSOVU2YTh5R081c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHm-vmaZiI9
 UCnFTODDSd0Gkfqc8v7tm_8M0Qp_LVy6VRqYzLbDDSIYy0Mqfu_aem_MUFbCVu6l_HgjH7qD5g
 4ow">https://www.wilsontannersmith.com</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T152632Z
LOCATION:Musta Kissa Bar\, Toinen linja 15\, 00530 Helsinki\, Suomi
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-JAZZFI-SOURCE:gcal
