DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/s/improvised-music-at
 -el-fant-on/2071603490415133/">Improvised Music at El Fant on 5 September 
 | Facebook</a><br><br>Olavi Louhivuori — drums<br>Harri Sjöström — s
 axophone<br>Jukka Kääriäinen — guitar<br><br>Entry by donation / Vapa
 aehtoinen pääsymaksu.<br><br>Three distinctive voices from the Finnish i
 mprovised and contemporary music scene come together for a special evening
  at El Fant Café &amp\; Bar.<br><br>Olavi Louhivuori is a Helsinki-based 
 drummer\, composer and improviser whose work moves across contemporary jaz
 z and improvised music. He has performed internationally both as a bandlea
 der and solo drummer\, and is known for his work with ensembles including 
 Oddarrang\, Ilmiliekki Quartet\, Joona Toivanen Trio\, Linda Fredriksson J
 uniper\, Alexi Tuomarila Trio and Superposition. <br><br>Harri Sjöström 
 is a renowned improvisational musician who has worked extensively across E
 urope. He has been involved in ensembles including Move-quintet\, ECIO and
  Quintet Moderne\, and collaborated with musicians such as Evan Parker and
  Philipp Wachsmann. From 1990 to 2016\, Sjöström collaborated with Cecil
  Taylor. <br><br>Jukka Kääriäinen is a Helsinki-based musician and soun
 d artist working in experimental\, improvised and contemporary music. He i
 s an active performer in the Finnish scene and has collaborated with music
 ians including Kalle Kalima\, Mikko Innanen\, Rieko Okuda and Camila Nebbi
 a.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T081210Z
LOCATION:El Fant Coffee & Wine Bar\, Katariinankatu 3\, 00170 Helsinki\, S
 uomi
