DESCRIPTION:tÿpo jäzz is a jazz event hosted by saxophonist Max Zenger a
 nd drummer Okko Saastamoinen at Bar tÿpo.\n\nThe 46th tÿpo jäzz is happ
 ening on Wed 26.8.\n\nMax Zenger\, Seppo Kitachev and Eero Tikkanen will u
 nite for the first time to explore each others compositions\, share respon
 sability and take risks as a brand new trio called Kolmio.\n\nKolmio is th
 e result of bringing together three segments uniting them into one object 
 each segment overlapping each other. This triangle can be stretched and al
 tered\, changing the size of the segments and the angel they overlap in wh
 ile still keeping the integrity of the original form.\n\nMax Zenger alto s
 ax and bass clarinet \nSeppo Kitachev guitar \nEero Tikkanen double bass\n
 \nFree entrance\, voluntary donation.\n\nWELCOME!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260815T200005Z
LOCATION:Bar tÿpo\, Tekstin talo\, Lintulahdenkatu 3\, 00530 Helsinki\, S
 uomi
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-JAZZFI-SOURCE:gcal
