DESCRIPTION:HI-HAT Art Bar TAITEIDENYÖ: Topi Paavilainen & Matti Ruuskane
 n\n\nCelebrate TAITEIDENYÖ with a live performance by Topi Paavilainen & 
 Matti Ruuskanen.\n\nPerforming on piano\, double bass\, and violin\, the d
 uo blends Finnish folk songs\, jazz\, traditional fiddle music\, and free 
 improvisation into a distinctive acoustic sound. Their program features or
 iginal compositions as well as imaginative arrangements of both well-known
  and hidden musical gems\, creating an intimate concert where tradition an
 d spontaneity meet.\n\nFree entry. Artist support is warmly appreciated.
